WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.770
Water is wonderful!

2
00:00:10.771 --> 00:00:15.141
Do you know why?

3
00:00:15.142 --> 00:00:19.385
We all need water to wash our hands and faces.

4
00:00:19.386 --> 00:00:23.860
Water is wonderful!

5
00:00:23.861 --> 00:00:27.256
Mommy needs water to make lemonade.

6
00:00:27.257 --> 00:00:32.246
Water is wonderful!

7
00:00:32.247 --> 00:00:36.475
Farmers need water to grow fruits and vegetables.

8
00:00:36.476 --> 00:00:40.764
Water is wonderful!

9
00:00:40.765 --> 00:00:44.280
Dams need water to make electricity.

10
00:00:44.281 --> 00:00:49.027
Water is wonderful!

11
00:00:49.028 --> 00:00:52.943
Firefighters need water to put out fires.

12
00:00:52.944 --> 00:00:57.404
Water is wonderful!

13
00:00:57.405 --> 00:01:00.886
People need water to be healthy.

14
00:01:00.887 --> 00:01:06.698
Water is wonderful!

15
00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:08.969
We need water to swim.

16
00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:14.029
Water is wonderful!

17
00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:16.337
Fish need water to breathe.

18
00:01:16.338 --> 00:01:21.401
Water is wonderful!

19
00:01:21.402 --> 00:01:24.465
Water helps us in many ways.

20
00:01:24.466 --> 00:01:30.785
So we need to keep our water clean!
